#: ../../source/getting_started/installation.rst:19
msgid ""
"LMCache does not support Windows natively. To run LMCache on Windows, you"
" can use the Windows Subsystem for Linux (WSL) with a compatible Linux "
"distribution, or use some community-maintained forks."
msgstr "LMCache 本身不支持 Windows。要在 Windows 上运行 LMCache，您可以使用 Windows Subsystem for Linux (WSL) 配合兼容的 Linux 发行版，或使用一些社区维护的分支。"

#: ../../source/getting_started/installation.rst:22
msgid "(Recommended) Install Stable LMCache from PyPI"
msgstr "（推荐）从 PyPI 安装稳定版 LMCache"

#: ../../source/getting_started/installation.rst:24
msgid ""
"The simplest way to install the latest stable release of LMCache is "
"through PyPI. If you require a different version of torch for the LMCache"
" instance that you built with (symbol undefined error), please follow the"
" install from source instructions below."
msgstr "安装 LMCache 最新稳定版本的最简单方法是通过 PyPI。如果您需要为所构建的 LMCache 实例使用不同版本的 torch（符号未定义错误），请按照下面的从源码安装说明进行操作。"

#: ../../source/getting_started/installation.rst:37
msgid ""
"You're all set! You can now start using LMCache. For hands-on guides and "
"more usage examples, see the :ref:`quickstart_examples` section."
msgstr "一切准备就绪！您现在可以开始使用 LMCache 了。有关实践指南和更多使用示例，请参阅 :ref:`quickstart_examples` 章节。"

