#: ../../source/getting_started/installation.rst:190
msgid ""
"The `AMD Infinity hub <https://hub.docker.com/r/rocm/vllm-dev>`__ for "
"vLLM offers a prebuilt, optimized docker image designed for validating "
"inference performance on the AMD Instinct™ MI300X accelerator. The image "
"is based on the latest vLLM v1. Please check `LLM inference performance "
"validation on AMD Instinct MI300X <https://rocm.docs.amd.com/en/latest"
"/how-to/rocm-for-ai/inference/benchmark-"
"docker/vllm.html?model=pyt_vllm_llama-3.1-8b>`__ for instructions on how "
"to use this prebuilt docker image."
msgstr "vLLM 的 `AMD Infinity hub <https://hub.docker.com/r/rocm/vllm-dev>`__ 提供了预构建的优化 Docker 镜像，专为在 AMD Instinct™ MI300X 加速器上验证推理性能而设计。该镜像基于最新的 vLLM v1。请查看 `AMD Instinct MI300X 上的 LLM 推理性能验证 <https://rocm.docs.amd.com/en/latest/how-to/rocm-for-ai/inference/benchmark-docker/vllm.html?model=pyt_vllm_llama-3.1-8b>`__ 了解如何使用此预构建 Docker 镜像的说明。"

